  "title": {
    "text": "Denser regions have more job churn, in and outside London",
    "subtitle": [
      "ITL2 regions, 2018\u201324: job reallocation rate and population-weighted density, both pooled over the period. Correlation 0.78; 0.50 excluding London.",
      "Population-weighted density: density of the small area the average resident lives in. Grey line = fit across all regions.",
